          "1": {
            "value": "Hi,\n\nI reviewed the proposed changes to the event sourcing layer. Overall the design looks solid, but I have a few concerns about the retry mechanism.\n\n1. The exponential backoff should cap at 30 seconds, not 60\n2. We need a circuit breaker for the downstream API calls\n3. The dead letter queue configuration needs to handle schema versioning\n\nI've added inline comments to the design doc. Let's discuss in our 1:1 on Thursday.\n\nThanks,\nCarol",
